Vendored third-party schemas
===========================

The files in this directory are copied verbatim from:

  knapsack-oss/design-system-contract
  https://github.com/knapsack-oss/design-system-contract
  branch: main
  format v0.1, spec v0.11.0 (2026-09-24)

  - component.contract.schema.json
  - manifest.schema.json

They are vendored so that the projection in `scripts/contracts/` can validate
its output against the target format's own published schema, offline, in CI.
They are not modified. Where they and the projection disagree, the projection
is wrong.

